bluejetty:00039769:ios.description:
Argo Travel Mobile is now My Argo!
My Argo is Argo's official app, combining the best of our travel management and expense management products into a single solution.
In addition to requesting, tracking, and approving your company's trips, now you can also:
- Record your expenses with autofill via OCR and QR Code;
- Log your trips (Km) by indicating on the map or with GPS;
- Automatically sync expenses and receipts;
- Request reimbursement;
- Account for advances or trips.
Much more ease and convenience for your day-to-day.

